{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>ErrorBank 是一款專為錯題重練而設的學習筆記 App，適合準備入學試、國家考試、高中考試，或希望停止重複犯錯的學習者。它讓使用者拍下做錯或未能解答的題目，再配合智能複習反覆練習，直至真正掌握。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-129.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>錯題標籤智能複習</h2>\n<p>ErrorBank 讓你拍下或匯入錯題，裁剪後按科目、主題與難度標籤整理，方便搜尋篩選。可直接在題目或空白頁手寫繪圖，兼容型號的 iPad 支援 Apple Pencil。每題可設定 1 至 10 次正確解答目標，智能複習按掌握程度安排重現時間，答錯不會清除進度。App 可離線使用，並提供準確率、每日統計、學習連續日數、到期提醒及 PDF 匯出。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-119-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-120-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-121-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-122-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-123-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-124-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：ErrorBank: Mistake Notebook</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/errorbank-mistake-notebook/id6774787840?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.525207+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":369,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T22:24:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:16:42.092183+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:42.748478+00:00","content_hash":"6761b1e07fe04946ee84a17e863cd673314ac34e12eb7df8f4bfad80de4b903a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}